OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian launchers on Larak
OL,4,AIsland in first known attack in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS forces struck two Iranian launchers
OL,7,Fon Iran's Larak island on Sunday, a US
OL,8,Fofficial said, the first known American
OL,9,Fstrikes on Iran since late July.
OL,11,F"Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps
OL,12,F(IRGC) forces were observed preparing
OL,13,Fto launch rockets with sea mines into
OL,14,FStrait of Hormuz," the BBC's US partner
OL,15,FCBS News quoted US Central Command
OL,16,Fspokesman Commander Tim Hawkins as
OL,17,Fsaying.
OL,19,FThe IRCG said the attack on Sunday
OL,20,Fkilled and wounded several people and
OL,21,Fvowed "response and punishment".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
