OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian launchers on Larak
OL,4,AIsland in first known attack in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt marks the first known US strike in
OL,7,FIran since President Trump paused a
OL,8,Frenewed military campaign in late July.
OL,9,FEarlier this month, the US military
OL,10,Fsaid it had finished clearing all mines
OL,11,Ffrom the strait's main shipping lane.
